        <mxCell id="insight-content" value="Just like a real assembly line: &lt;b&gt;you can swap out parts without redesigning the whole factory&lt;/b&gt;. Change where the experiment data comes from (Layer 1)? The engine doesn't care. Update how success is calculated (Layer 3)? The engine keeps running. The &lt;b&gt;layers are independent&lt;/b&gt;, and the &lt;b&gt;engine is stable&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
